#
#	OpenTPW winter extension: the winter kiosk (modelled on the keys of the original balloon shop, a shop). It sells a head item (a bobble hat or earmuffs) and then mittens.
#	Every number marked "OpenTPW's own value" is a choice of this extension (docs/WINTER.md, [EXT:winter-kiosk]). Nothing is read from Theme Park World's or Theme Park Inc's data.
#
Info.Id			64010		placeholder: objects.json replaces it with the object's own id
Info.Name		"Winter Kiosk"
Info.IsChoosable	1
Info.HasQueue		0		a shop: guests walk to it and buy, no queue
Info.WhichUIType	1		a shop (the build menu's Shops tab)

# A 2 x 2 market hut. The entrance '2' (where the customer stands, facing the counter) is the lower left cell.
Info.Shape
---
**
2*
---

# The construction fence for 2 x 2 cells: the four corner pieces
Info.Hoarding
---
F7
LJ
---

# 1 = a gift shop's kind (not 5, which the challenges and the costume statistics would count as costumes; OpenTPW's own value)
UsageInfo.ShopType			1
UsageInfo.InitCostOfGoods		10		OpenTPW's own value
UsageInfo.InitPricePerUse		25		OpenTPW's own value (decision of October 18, 2026)
UsageInfo.EntryCellStandPosX	0.5
UsageInfo.EntryCellStandPosY	0.5
UsageInfo.ExitCellAppearPosX	0.5
UsageInfo.ExitCellAppearPosY	0.5
UsageInfo.RideHandlesSprite	1		the shop's script hides the customer while serving (as the balloon shop)
UsageInfo.MinCapacity		0		always zero for shops
UsageInfo.MaxCapacity		0		always zero for shops

# Not indoors, so the original's indoor-in-rain bonus does not stack on the kiosk's own demand percentages below
UsageInfo.ISIndoors			0

UsageInfo.ThirstEffect		0
UsageInfo.HungerEffect		0
UsageInfo.VomitEffect		0
UsageInfo.HappinessEffect		15		OpenTPW's own value
UsageInfo.LitterEffect		5		OpenTPW's own value

# 4 = the guest gets a warm item: a head item first (hat or earmuffs), then mittens (1 balloon, 2 costume and 3 umbrella are the other values in use; 4 is this extension's)
UsageInfo.AppearanceEffect		4

# Demand, percent of the attraction score (read by the winter extension for its own objects only; the original does not read these keys).
# The weather keys are Theme Park Inc's names, the season keys are this extension's own ([EXT:winter-season-terms]); months Dec-Feb, Mar-May, Jun-Aug, Sep-Nov.
# The kiosk sells all year and its demand follows the season and the snow (the user's decision of 2026-10-18/19, "Het hele jaar, vraag via seizoen"); only a guest with both slots full scores 0.
WeatherModifier.SnowPercentage		200		OpenTPW's own value
WeatherModifier.RainPercentage		0
WeatherModifier.StormPercentage		0
SeasonModifier.WinterPercentage	150
SeasonModifier.SpringPercentage	60
SeasonModifier.SummerPercentage	20
SeasonModifier.AutumnPercentage	60

Research.Group		0		available from the start, no research
Info.PreviewAnimNum		0

Upgrades[0].InitCapacity		5		OpenTPW's own value
Upgrades[0].CostOfUpgrade		1000		OpenTPW's own value
Upgrades[0].CostOfResearch		0		An object without research cost starts researched
Upgrades[0].RunningCost		30		OpenTPW's own value (a Theme Park Inc key; the original does not read it)
